From: sneezeparty <38020091+sneezeparty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 10:41:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] screencast: The compositor clamps hidden_refresh

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/protocols/zkde-screencast-unstable-v1.xml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/protocols/zkde-screencast-unstable-v1.xml b/src/protocols/zkde-screencast-unstable-v1.xml
index 4773bdd..11619db 100644
--- a/src/protocols/zkde-screencast-unstable-v1.xml
+++ b/src/protocols/zkde-screencast-unstable-v1.xml
@@ -117,7 +117,7 @@
                 Windows of a virtual desktop that is not shown are not on
                 screen and would not draw. hidden_refresh is how many times
                 a second the compositor asks them to draw for this stream,
-                0 for the compositor's default. The compositor may clamp it.
+                0 for the compositor's default. The compositor clamps it.
             </description>
             <arg name="stream" type="new_id" interface="zkde_screencast_stream_unstable_v1"/>
             <arg name="desktop_id" type="string" summary="virtual desktop Identifier"/>
